  "modelPrompt": {
    "subject_definitions": "<Subject 1> Ice-crystal money tree with crystalline branches, ice-faceted coins and floating ice-particle effects, motion and timing from <Video 1>\n<Video 1> Source video containing the original golden money tree animation against solid blue background",
    "summary": "[video editing] The target video is an edited version of <Video 1>. Replace the golden coin tree and coin particle effects with an ice-crystal theme while retaining all growth and falling motion paths, timing and rhythm; keep the original solid blue background unchanged.",
    "retention_analysis": "<Subject 1>: attribute_transfer - ice-crystal material, facets and particle shapes applied to tree and coins\n<Video 1>: partially_preserved - original growth trajectory, falling paths, particle timing, camera framing and solid blue background retained",
    "detailed_description": "Ice-crystal visual style. [Shot 1] Centered against solid blue background, the ice-crystal money tree grows from a crystalline pot, its branches extending with faceted ice coins; at 0.500 s additional ice coins form and settle; at 1.000 s a bright crystalline glow pulses from the canopy; at 1.500 s ice particles burst outward and begin drifting; at 2.000 s and 2.500 s more ice particles float down while the tree reaches full size; at 3.000 s the tree stands complete with lingering drifting ice particles, all motion paths and rhythm identical to <Video 1>.",
    "overall_soundscape": "N/A",
    "non_diegetic_music": "N/A"
  },
  "displayPrompt": {
    "subject_definitions": "<Subject 1> 冰晶材质的金钱树，带有结晶树枝、冰面硬币以及漂浮冰晶粒子特效，动作与时序来自 <Video 1>\n<Video 1> 包含原始金色金钱树动画的源视频，背景为纯蓝色",
    "summary": "[video editing] 目标视频是 <Video 1> 的编辑版本。将金色金币树和金币粒子特效替换为冰晶主题，同时保留所有生长与飘落动作路径、节奏与时序；保持原有纯蓝色背景不变。",
    "retention_analysis": "<Subject 1>: attribute_transfer - 将冰晶材质、切面与粒子形状应用于树木和硬币\n<Video 1>: partially_preserved - 保留原始生长轨迹、飘落路径、粒子时序、摄像机构图及纯蓝色背景",
    "detailed_description": "冰晶视觉风格。[Shot 1] 以纯蓝色为背景，冰晶金钱树从结晶花盆中生长，树枝伸展并长出冰面硬币；0.500 秒时更多冰晶硬币形成并落定；1.000 秒时树冠发出明亮晶体光晕；1.500 秒时冰晶粒子爆发并开始飘落；2.000 秒与 2.500 秒时更多冰晶粒子持续飘落，树木达到完整大小；3.000 秒时树木完全成型，残留冰晶粒子继续飘动，所有动作路径与节奏与 <Video 1> 完全一致。",
    "overall_soundscape": "N/A",
    "non_diegetic_music": "N/A"
  }
}
